OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe risk of a few light showers
OL,6,Facross northern Aberdeenshire at
OL,7,Ffirst. Otherwise a dry day with sunny
OL,8,Fintervals turning hazier later in the
OL,9,Fday. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright evening with
OL,12,Fvariable cloud and a few hazy sunny
OL,13,Fspells. The rest of the night will
OL,14,Fthen be mainly dry with clear spells
OL,15,Fat first but cloudier later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,18,Fspreading northwards, becoming
OL,19,Fwidespread and often heavy and
OL,20,Fpersistent in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
